  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I speak in the tongues",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of men or of angels, but do not have love, I am only a resounding gong or a clanging cymbal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I have the gift of prophecy and can fathom all mysteries and all knowledge, and if I have a faith that can move mountains, but do not have love, I am nothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I give all I possess to the poor and give over my body to hardship that I may boast,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "but do not have love, I gain nothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Love is patient, love is kind. It does not envy, it does not boast, it is not proud.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It does not dishonor others, it is not self-seeking, it is not easily angered, it keeps no record of wrongs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Love does not delight in evil but rejoices with the truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It always protects, always trusts, always hopes, always perseveres.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Love never fails. But where there are prophecies, they will cease; where there are tongues, they will be stilled; where there is knowledge, it will pass away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we know in part and we prophesy in part,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but when completeness comes, what is in part disappears.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I was a child, I talked like a child, I thought like a child, I reasoned like a child. When I became a man, I put the ways of childhood behind me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For now we see only a reflection as in a mirror; then we shall see face to face. Now I know in part; then I shall know fully, even as I am fully known.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now these three remain: faith, hope and love. But the greatest of these is love.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
